{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo contains all content unlocked from the start to provide opportunities to strategize. The full game will contain more content that will be unlocked through playing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>(The Demo) Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ dice</strong> with unique faces and abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12 scoring hands</strong> with distinct rules to discover and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ items</strong> that alter the odds in your favor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for <strong>30-minute runs</strong> with infinite replayability  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push your limits in <strong>Endless Mode</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep strategy</strong> meets chaotic dice-rolling engine building</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...and more to come in the <strong>full release</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/extras/44cff301917c29b884d22c16985154a0.poster.avif?t=1752500784\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/extras/44cff301917c29b884d22c16985154a0.apng?t=1752500784\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diecast </strong>is a dice-rolling roguelike about pushing your luck, building wild combos, and chasing impossible scores across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll and reroll your way to victory by crafting the perfect scoring hand</strong>. Use your winnings to buy powerful new dice with unique faces and abilities, unlock different scoring options, and collect strange items that bend the odds in your favor. Every run is a chance to discover a new strategy\u2014and tempt Lady Luck a little further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/extras/be0dc2ca77c3c316071a7dd585e87a32.poster.avif?t=1752500784\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/extras/be0dc2ca77c3c316071a7dd585e87a32.apng?t=1752500784\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against rule-breaking boss rounds that force you to adapt. Build your strategy around them, or come crashing down to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/extras/5eaa24b96c6b6c856df27fbf03788e24.poster.avif?t=1752500784\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/extras/5eaa24b96c6b6c856df27fbf03788e24.apng?t=1752500784\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861370?t=1752500784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/3a8e5f112170412aebc2e3ee84690456e05119f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752500784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/e3c881c83a31b24cad731102ebb8394c1f91a4bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752500784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861370/e3c881c83a31b24cad731102ebb8394c1f91a4bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752500784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo",